6. Count occurrences of each element in a list
------------------------------------------------------------

object Assignment6 {
  def main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {
    val values = List(1, 2, 2, 3, 1, 2, 4, 3)

    val counts = values.groupBy(identity).map {
      case (value, occurrences) => value -> occurrences.size
    }

    println("List: " + values.mkString(", "))
    println("Occurrences: " + counts)
  }
}

Sample output (map order may vary):
List: 1, 2, 2, 3, 1, 2, 4, 3
Occurrences: Map(1 -> 2, 2 -> 3, 3 -> 2, 4 -> 1)


