7. Create a map and find keys with the maximum value
------------------------------------------------------------

object Assignment7 {
  def main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {
    val values = Map("Red" -> 1, "Green" -> 4, "Blue" -> 3, "Orange" -> 4)

    val maxValue = values.values.max
    val keys = values.filter { case (_, value) => value == maxValue }.keySet

    println("Original map: " + values)
    println("Maximum value: " + maxValue)
    println("Keys with maximum value: " + keys)
  }
}

Sample output:
Original map: Map(Red -> 1, Green -> 4, Blue -> 3, Orange -> 4)
Maximum value: 4
Keys with maximum value: Set(Green, Orange)

